# Every Security.framework symbol a Hirsel program may import on aarch64-apple-darwin,
# one Mach-O name per line, sorted. link_kit.py turns it into the kit's Security.tbd.
# Only Trust.System reaches it: the system and admin Keychain trust settings
# (DECISIONS D4). A program that never reaches Trust.System drops the framework at
# link time (-dead_strip_dylibs).

_SecCertificateCopyData
_SecCopyErrorMessageString
_SecTrustSettingsCopyCertificates
_SecTrustSettingsCopyTrustSettings
